sPDMX dataset license
=====================

The contents of this directory (dense MIDI under mid/, audio stems under
audio/, and SPDMX.csv) are released under the Creative Commons
Attribution 4.0 International License (CC BY 4.0):

    https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

You are free to share and adapt the material for any purpose, including
commercially, provided you give appropriate credit.

Underlying symbolic scores come from PDMX, a public-domain MusicXML/MIDI
collection (Long et al., ICASSP 2025). Join this package to PDMX.csv on
song_id: PDMX path is ./data/{song_id}.json and PDMX MIDI is
./mid/{song_id}.mid.
